OL,3,GNEWSAEA clarifies use of halal chicken
OL,4,Ain school canteens after
OL,5,A'misinformation'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHalal (Arabic for permissible) food is
OL,8,Fprepared according to strict Islamic
OL,9,Fdietary laws, as defined in the Koran,
OL,10,Fwhich forbid the consumption of pork or
OL,11,Falcohol; halal meat requires a
OL,12,Fprescribed method of animal slaughter.
